.SH "Member Function Documentation"
.PP 
.SS " Optional[Type[\fBTreeBuilder\fP]] bs4\&.builder\&.TreeBuilderRegistry\&.lookup ( self, *str features)"

.PP
.nf
Look up a TreeBuilder subclass with the desired features\&.

:param features: A list of features to look for\&. If none are
    provided, the most recently registered TreeBuilder subclass
    will be used\&.
:return: A TreeBuilder subclass, or None if there's no
    registered subclass with all the requested features\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.SS " None bs4\&.builder\&.TreeBuilderRegistry\&.register ( self, type[\fBTreeBuilder\fP] treebuilder_class)"

.PP
.nf
Register a treebuilder based on its advertised features\&.

:param treebuilder_class: A subclass of `TreeBuilder`\&. its
   `TreeBuilder\&.features` attribute should list its features\&.

.fi
.PP
 
